# Placeholder so git tracks this directory.
#
# RethinkDB stores its data in a binary format and our schema is created
# programmatically by stf-app on first start (see stf/lib/db/setup.js
# in the upstream submodule). We may add SQL-shaped reference dumps here
# in the future for analytics/export pipelines, but the dir starts empty.
#
# The Dockerfile's `COPY sql/ sql/` step needs the directory to exist on
# the build context, which means we need at least one file checked in --
# git does not track empty directories.
